	"comment": "Fixed vectors for the root's VerifyPresenceUse, VerifyPresenceCountersignature and VerifyPresenceRegistration (§16.6's profiles, §7.9's presence row; D-MCP-19, FS-124, QD-086). Keys are synthetic: a key's P-256 scalar is SHA-256(\"urnetwork-sidecar-test/presence-key\" || seed) and its key_id the first 16 bytes of SHA-256(\"urnetwork-sidecar-test/presence-key-id\" || seed), as sidecartest.FixturePresenceKey derives them; public keys are SEC 1 uncompressed. Signatures are RFC 6979 deterministic. Every assertion reports origin https://ur.io, QD-073's for every host but Android, which the release table holds. A use is checked from stored_count, and count_after is what a counter holds after. Bytes are lowercase hex. go test -run TestPresenceVectors -update-presence-vectors rewrites this file, which is a format change.",
